   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "ging, as if striving to get a still better seaward peep. But",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 61.11888888888887,
   "x1": 101.0,
   "y1": 64.61888888888888,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "these are all landsmen; of week days pent up in lath and",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 65.49333333333331,
   "x1": 101.00000000000004,
   "y1": 68.99333333333331,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "plaster—tied to counters, nailed to benches, clinched to",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 69.86777777777776,
   "x1": 101.0,
   "y1": 73.36777777777776,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "desks. How then is this? Are the green fields gone?",
