   "y0": 74.24222222222221,
   "x1": 101.0,
   "y1": 77.74222222222221,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What do they here?",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 78.61666666666666,
   "x1": 42.916666666666664,
   "y1": 82.11666666666666,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But look! here come more crowds, pacing straight",
   "x0": 17.875,
   "y0": 82.99111111111111,
   "x1": 100.95833333333333,
   "y1": 86.49111111111111,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "for the water, and seemingly bound for a dive. Strange!",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 87.36555555555556,
   "x1": 101.0,
   "y1": 90.86555555555556,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing will content them but the extremest limit of the",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 91.74000000000001,
   "x1": 101.0,
   "y1": 95.24000000000001,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "land; loitering under the shady lee of yonder",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 96.11444444444446,
   "x1": 100.0,
   "y1": 99.61444444444446,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "warehouses will not suffice. No. They must get just as",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 100.48888888888891,
   "x1": 101.0,
   "y1": 103.98888888888891,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "nigh the water as they possibly can without falling in.",
