   "y0": 104.86333333333336,
   "x1": 101.0,
   "y1": 108.36333333333336,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And there they stand—miles of them—leagues. Inlan-",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 109.23777777777781,
   "x1": 101.0,
   "y1": 112.73777777777781,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": true,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "ders all, they come from lanes and alleys, streets and",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 113.61222222222226,
   "x1": 101.0,
   "y1": 117.11222222222226,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "avenues—north, east, south, and west. Yet here they all",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 117.98666666666671,
   "x1": 101.0,
   "y1": 121.48666666666671,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "unite. Tell me, does the magnetic virtue of the needles",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 122.36111111111116,
   "x1": 101.0,
   "y1": 125.86111111111116,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "of the compasses of all those ships attract them thither?",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 126.7355555555556,
   "x1": 99.5,
   "y1": 130.2355555555556,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": true,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Once more. Say you are in the country; in some",
   "x0": 17.875,
   "y0": 131.11000000000004,
   "x1": 100.9583333333333,
   "y1": 134.61000000000004,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "high land of lakes. Take almost any path you please,",
   "x0": 12.0,
   "y0": 135.48444444444448,
   "x1": 100.99999999999999,
   "y1": 138.98444444444448,
   "col": 0,
   "heading": false,
   "para_end": false,
   "soft_hyphen": false,
   "hard_break_hyphen": false
  },
  {
   "text": "and ten to one it carries you down in a dale, and leaves",
